  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>SST302 - Binomial Distribution</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A manufacturing process has a \({@p_percent@}\%\) success rate for producing defect-free items.</p>
<p>If \({@n@}\) items are inspected, what is the probability that exactly \({@k@}\) items are defect-free?</p>
<p>Give your answer to 4 decimal places.</p>
<p>Probability = [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>Binomial probability formula:</p>
<p>\[ P(X = k) = \binom{n}{k} p^k (1 - p)^{n-k} \]</p>
<p>where \(p = {@p@}\), \(n = {@n@}\), and \(k = {@k@}\).</p>
<p>First, calculate combinations:</p>
<p>\[ \binom{{@n@}}{{@k@}} = \frac{{@n@}!}{{@k@}!({@n@}-{@k@})!} = {@combinations@} \]</p>
<p>Now, applying the formula:</p>
<p>\[ P(X = {@k@}) = {@combinations@} ({@p@})^{@k@} ({@1-p@})^{@n-k@} \]</p>
<p>\[ \approx {@ta1@} \]</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
